21:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[["$","section","0-Choose the calculation you need",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Choose the calculation you need"}],[["$","p","The required-score mode answers what you need on the final to reach a target. The projected-grade mode answers what the overall course grade would be with an expected exam result. All scores here use a 0–100 percentage scale.",{"children":"The required-score mode answers what you need on the final to reach a target. The projected-grade mode answers what the overall course grade would be with an expected exam result. All scores here use a 0–100 percentage scale."}],["$","p","Your current average must represent the completed non-final portion after the institution’s weighting rules. If the gradebook counts future missing work as zero, or excludes categories not yet graded, first establish which average belongs in the formula.",{"children":"Your current average must represent the completed non-final portion after the institution’s weighting rules. If the gradebook counts future missing work as zero, or excludes categories not yet graded, first establish which average belongs in the formula."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","1-A worked required-final example",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A worked required-final example"}],[["$","p","Suppose your current average is 80%, the final counts for 40% and your target is 85%. The completed work contributes 80 × 0.60 = 48 percentage points. The final must contribute 85 − 48 = 37 points.",{"children":"Suppose your current average is 80%, the final counts for 40% and your target is 85%. The completed work contributes 80 × 0.60 = 48 percentage points. The final must contribute 85 − 48 = 37 points."}],["$","p","Keep a buffer if your institution rounds at the end or uses a separate minimum in the examination. This tool displays the arithmetic; it does not override the course’s grading policy.",{"children":"Keep a buffer if your institution rounds at the end or uses a separate minimum in the examination. This tool displays the arithmetic; it does not override the course’s grading policy."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","aside",null,{"className":"worked-example","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Worked example"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Required exam score = 37 ÷ 0.40 = 92.5%. Check: 80 × 0.60 + 92.5 × 0.40 = 85%. The final exam contributes 37 course points; that is not the same as a 37% exam score."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Understand an impossible or already secured target",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Understand an impossible or already secured target"}],[["$","p","A required result above 100% is outside this tool’s assumed maximum. The output should say that the target is not reachable under the entered model, rather than implying extra credit exists. If your course permits extra credit, consult its policy separately.",{"children":"A required result above 100% is outside this tool’s assumed maximum. The output should say that the target is not reachable under the entered model, rather than implying extra credit exists. If your course permits extra credit, consult its policy separately."}],["$","p","A result at or below zero means the arithmetic target is reached even with zero on the final. It does not establish that you may skip the examination: attendance, submission or minimum-exam conditions can still apply.",{"children":"A result at or below zero means the arithmetic target is reached even with zero on the final. It does not establish that you may skip the examination: attendance, submission or minimum-exam conditions can still apply."}]],"$undefined","$L24","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L25","$L26","$L27"]}]
